  "version": "1.7.0",
  "changelog": "New stop shortcut (default F7, changeable in Settings): while the app is working, moving your mouse no longer takes control back - only the stop shortcut stops everything, even in the middle of a hold. Button detection fixed: if the quick try misses, the full check now runs in the SAME scan, so a PRESS AND HOLD button sitting on screen is found reliably again (every scan result and its time are written in the log). Cursor ring fixed: it now stays glued to the mouse pointer instead of drifting away. Hold fixed: a hold is never released early by one bad reading, and long holds are supported - the safety limit is now 5 minutes and can be set from 30 to 600 seconds in Settings.",
